WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.505
Where the heaviest stars are.

00:01.860 --> 00:08.546
At its heart is the cluster R one three six, under two million years old, whose light makes most of the nebula glow.

00:09.135 --> 00:13.370
Its brightest star is among the heaviest known, two to three hundred Suns.

00:14.031 --> 00:17.052
The stars drawn are a sample, at its real place.
